---
source: crates/togi/tests/cli.rs
expression: "help_output(& [\"--help\"])"
---
Polyglot formatter and linter for data science projects: R, Python, Quarto/Markdown, and SQL behind one stable interface

Usage: togi [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  format       Format project files in place (R, Python, Quarto, SQL, Markdown)
  lint         Report lint violations across the project
  tools        Manage togi-installed formatter/linter tools (advanced)
  completions  Generate shell completions
  version      Print the togi version and the tool versions baked into this release
  upgrade      Upgrade togi to the latest release
  help         Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -v, --verbose        Show more detail (underlying commands, tool names)
  -q, --quiet          Suppress all output except errors
      --no-color       Disable colored output
      --config <PATH>  Use this config file instead of discovering togi.toml
  -h, --help           Print help
  -V, --version        Print version
